note The rows. rows_window turns the scroll offset into the first visible line and emits the spacer for the lines above; then one code block of the visible lines plus two, then a spacer for the rest plus a row of slack, so the scrollbar sees the whole file while only what shows is drawn. A plain click on a line selects it, shift extends.

