note The one code element in the GUI: a block of lines drawn from a cached grid by a custom element, with the hover, jump and peek gestures resolved to (line, column) from the pointer. Per-row backgrounds and bars come from two closures, so the listing's selection and anchor bars and the document's slice highlight all share it.

